*~

# Local agent agreements, session history and private research notes.
# Public documentation is allowlisted after review; tracked docs still need cleanup.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/*
!/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md

# Publication-only exclusions: private transfer helpers and generated native output.
/scripts/
